('logic','All A are B. No B are C. Can any A be C? Reply only yes or no.',['no']),('logic','Some poets are scientists. All scientists are curious. Does it follow that some poets are curious? Reply only yes or no.',['yes']),('logic','If P implies Q and Q is false, must P be false? Reply only yes or no.',['yes']),('logic','If either Alice or Bob won, and Alice did not win, who won? Reply only with the name.',['bob']),('logic','A statement and its negation cannot both be true under which classical principle? Reply only with the principle.',['law of non contradiction','principle of non contradiction','non contradiction']),
