('law','What is the highest court in the United States? Reply only with the court name.',['supreme court','united states supreme court','us supreme court']),('law','A written false statement harming reputation is called what? Reply only with the term.',['libel']),('law','The burden of proof in most civil cases is called what? Reply only with the standard.',['preponderance of the evidence','preponderance of evidence']),('law','Latin term meaning a guilty mind? Reply only with the term.',['mens rea']),('law','What doctrine requires courts to follow precedent? Reply only with the Latin term.',['stare decisis']),
